# Recipe 8.4 - User interaction during tool loops (ask_user) and batch feedback
# Goal: Allow autonomous tool loops to prompt the user interactively when needed, or receive structured skip feedback in batch mode.
# Run: /source src/chatybot/doc/cookbook/08_4_ask_user_tool.chatdsl

/model devstral_1
/tool on
/tool auto on

# Prompt the agent to inspect files and ask before making modifications
chat --> Check the markdown files in docs/ and ask me which one should be refactored first.
